      <section class="body"><h2 class="section-title">Proven Leadership</h2>

<p class="statement">Andrew Cuomo fights every day to make progressive ideas a reality. Together we've made real change:</p>

<ul class="accomplishments"><li>Marriage Equality</li>
	<li>$15 Minimum Wage</li>
	<li>Paid Family Leave</li>
	<li>Tuition-Free College</li>
	<li>Gun<br />
	Safety</li>
</ul><p><a class="form-button" href="/issues" target="_blank">Learn More</a></p></section>

